        "1. Stage1: Collect and confirm user profile.\n"
        "2. Stage2: Analyze stocks and generate reports.\n"
        "3. Stage3: Use Stage1+Stage2 data to generate entry/exit plans.\n"
        "4. Stage4: Develop trading rules based on Stage3 plans.\n"
        "You can use rag_qa_tool as needed, but never stop between stages."
