        "\n"
        "#### Part B: Entry & Exit Plan (Tie to User’s Goal)\n"
        "**Entry & Exit for [Stock Name] ([Code])**\n"
        "1. Entry Trigger: Specific price/date (e.g., 'Nov 5, 2025 if price drops to ¥22' — use support level from market data).\n"
        "   Rationale: Link to stock data (e.g., '¥22 is Oct’s key support, aligns with user’s 10% fluctuation tolerance').\n"
        "2. Exit Trigger: Profit target + stop-loss (e.g., 'Apr 30, 2026 / ¥23.1 (stop-loss: ¥20.24)').\n"
        "   Rationale: Tie to user’s goal (e.g., '¥23.1 = 5% earnings (user’s short-term goal); ¥20.24 = 8% loss (within 10% max)').\n"
        "\n"
        "#### Part C: Actionable Trading Rules (Specific & Executable)\n"
        "Follow this template (use stock data to fill details):\n"
        "**Trading Rules for [Stock Name] ([Code])**\n"
        "(Pre-requisite: Key data from tools — e.g., 'Oct support ¥22, Q3 profit +250%, debt 47.74%')\n"
        "\n"
        "1. Buying-in Rules (2 rules max):\n"
        "   - Rule 1: Trigger (e.g., 'Nov 5, 2025 if price ≤¥22 AND volume ≥50k shares'); Action (e.g., 'Buy 400 shares ($8,800, 8% of $100k principal)'); Rationale (e.g., '¥22 is support, volume ensures liquidity').\n"
        "   - Rule 2: Trigger (e.g., 'Nov 10 if Q4 news confirms profit growth ≥10%'); Action (e.g., 'Buy 100 more shares ($2,200, total 10% of principal)'); Rationale (e.g., 'Profit growth confirms catalyst, avoids over-allocation').\n"
        "\n"
        "2. Selling-out Rules (2 rules max):\n"
        "   - Rule 1: Trigger (e.g., 'Price reaches ¥23.1 OR Apr 30, 2025 (whichever first)'); Action (e.g., 'Sell all 500 shares'); Rationale (e.g., '¥23.1 hits 5% earnings target').\n"
        "   - Rule 2: Trigger (e.g., 'Price drops ≤¥20.24 OR debt ratio rises to 55%'); Action (e.g., 'Sell all shares immediately'); Rationale (e.g., '¥20.24 limits loss to 8%, below 10% max tolerance').\n"
        "\n"
        "### Step 3: Compare & Select the Best Stock\n"
        "After printing 3-in-1 outputs for ALL stocks:\n"
        "1. **Compare all stocks** using 3 criteria:\n"
        "   - Alignment with 5% short-term earnings goal (catalysts, price momentum).\n"
        "   - Compliance with 10% max fluctuation (debt level, volatility).\n"
        "   - Fundamental strength (ROE, net profit growth, valuation).\n"
        "2. **Select 1 best stock** and print:\n"
        "   'Selected Stock: [Code] | [Name] | [Industry]'\n"
