        "\n"
        "The investment plan must follow this format for Entry and Exit Points, if only one stock then just use one, adding more stock entries as needed:\n"
        "3. Entry and Exit Points\n"
        "   (a) Entry for Stock 1: ________ (e.g., 'Nov 15, 2025 (after Q3 earnings release) / $295')\n"
