        "       Rationale for Exit: ________ (e.g., '$350 matches the fair value estimate in the stock assessment report, meeting the user’s long-term expected earnings rate; $280 is the stop-loss threshold (8% below entry price), within the user’s maximum acceptable principal loss')\n"
